  "body": "## Summary\n- remove the unused shared Key Vault URL from the runtime deployment env\n- update local docs/examples to match the App Configuration + Cosmos-only path\n- remove the stale anatomy doc pointer to `romaine-kv`\n\n## Checks\n- `helm template kill-me k8s`\n- `rg -n \"romaine-kv|KEY_VAULT_URL\" -S .`\n- `helm template kill-me k8s \u003e/tmp/kill-me-rendered.yaml \u0026\u0026 rg -n \"romaine-kv|KEY_VAULT_URL\" /tmp/kill-me-rendered.yaml || true`",
